    "html":  "\u003cdiv class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan typeof=\"mw:File\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/4/46/Nenne_%26_Kunne_The_Twin_Ice_Tyrants_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20251126002152\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Nenne \u0026amp; Kunne The Twin Ice Tyrants Queen\u0026#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"912\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Nenne \u0026amp; Kunne The Twin Ice Tyrants Queen\u0026#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Nenne_%26_Kunne_The_Twin_Ice_Tyrants_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/4/46/Nenne_%26_Kunne_The_Twin_Ice_Tyrants_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20251126002152\" /\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cb\u003eThe Twin Ice Tyrants\u003c/b\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eA duo of Beautiful Warriors, the older sister Nenne ad the younger sister Kunne, they frenzy their opponents using a cooperative skill that enhances Kunne\u0027s freezing power with Nenne amplification ability.\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThese beautiful warrior sisters are a little older than \u003ca href=\"/wiki/Nanashi\" title=\"Nanashi\"\u003eNanashi\u003c/a\u003e.\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThey seem to be getting a bit cocky after developing a special move that fires powerful ice arrows by combining Kunne\u0027s \"Freezing\" divine seal and Nenne\u0027s \"Amplification\" divine seal. Their distinctive way of speaking is that Nenne ends her sentences with \"~ssu\" and Kunne ends them with \"~ssho\".\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"bc78ece7c0f4be597efbcce4414174bf\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Nenne_stand-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:185px; width:134px;\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Nenne_stand.png\" title=\"Nenne stand.png (641 KB)\" style=\"height:185px; width:134px;\"\u003e\u003cnoscript\u003e\u003cimg style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/4/48/Nenne_stand.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/134?cb=20260317140723\" title=\"Nenne stand.png (641 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Nenne stand.png\" data-image-key=\"Nenne_stand.png\" data-relevant=\"1\"\u003e\u003c/noscript\u003e\u003cimg style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Nenne stand.png (641 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Nenne stand.png\" data-image-key=\"Nenne_stand.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/4/48/Nenne_stand.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/134?cb=20260317140723\" /\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Screenshot_2024-11-13_010228-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:184px; width:79px; top:0.5px;\"\u003e\u003ca cla